@HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Root Service Info
GET {{HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

### 2. List Videos
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/videos?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### 3. Upload Video (Multipart Form)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/videos/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="uploadedBy"

Instructor_John
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="videoFile"; filename="sample_lesson.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./sample_lesson.mp4
--boundary--

### 4. Get Video Status & Metadata (Replace with actual GUID)
@videoId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/videos/{{videoId}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Stream HLS Master Manifest
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/videos/{{videoId}}/manifest.m3u8

### 6. Get Video Thumbnail
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/videos/{{videoId}}/thumbnail

### 7. Delete Video
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/videos/{{videoId}}
